Descend into the Mazes of Menace in search of the fabled Amulet of
Yendor! Acquire strangely useful treasures and encounter monsters of every
description. Cope with Yet Another Stupid Death. Recover items from bones
piles. And finally play against another player in The NetHack Board Game!

On each turn, players choose if they will move quickly or carefully,
picking up handy items and fighting fearsome monsters as they move from
the Mazes of Menace through the Castle to Gehennom to retrieve the Amulet
and bring it back to the surface.

Included are three game boards (Mazes, Castle, and Gehennom), encounter
decks for each board, character cards (each with different play advantages
and limitations), dice, player pawns, and "bones" markers. Encounter
cards are cunningly illustrated in old school NetHack style.

Available at: http://www.thegamecrafter.com/games/the-nethack-board-game

Also available: the Gnomish Mines Expansion, the first expansion
set for the NetHack Board Game, provides new encounters and new
strategies. Venture into the Mines to acquire gemstones that can be used
to influence the game or interfere with the other player!
(And more to come...)

